# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Operator backpropagation (OBP)"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung für die neueste Version von Operator backpropagation (OBP)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the package, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Bevor du das Paket installierst, entscheide, wie du die Pakete ausführen und installieren möchtest. Dafür gibt es zwei grundlegende Wege:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Option 1: Installation von PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Option 2: Installation aus dem Quellcode](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preinstallation {#preinstallation}"
msgstr "Vorbereitung {#preinstallation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Erstelle zunächst eine minimale Umgebung, in der nur Python installiert ist. Wir empfehlen die Verwendung von [virtuellen Python-Umgebungen](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktiviere deine neue Umgebung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: If you are using Windows, use the following commands in PowerShell:\n"
msgstr "Hinweis: Wenn du Windows verwendest, nutze die folgenden Befehle in PowerShell:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Option 1: Installation von PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-obp` package is by using `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Der einfachste Weg, das Paket `qiskit-addon-obp` zu installieren, ist die Verwendung von `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Option 2: Installation aus dem Quellcode {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users who want to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally might want to install from source.\n"
msgstr "Nutzer, die im Repository entwickeln oder die Notebooks lokal ausführen möchten, installieren möglicherweise lieber aus dem Quellcode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-obp` repository.\n"
msgstr "Falls ja, ist der erste Schritt, das Repository `qiskit-addon-obp` zu klonen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Aktualisiere als Nächstes pip und wechsle in das Repository.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-obp` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies so you can run visualizations. If you plan on developing in the repository, you might want to install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Der nächste Schritt ist, `qiskit-addon-obp` in der virtuellen Umgebung zu installieren. Wenn du die Notebooks ausführen möchtest, installiere die Notebook-Abhängigkeiten, damit du Visualisierungen ausführen kannst. Wenn du im Repository entwickeln möchtest, kannst du die `dev`-Abhängigkeiten installieren.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Passe die folgenden Optionen an deine Bedürfnisse an.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs directory.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du die Notebook-Abhängigkeiten installiert hast, kannst du loslegen, indem du die Notebooks im Verzeichnis docs ausführst.\n"
